{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccamatthews.bsky.social/post/3lgvwocvjls2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "You can get coverage, every time, by running to media when something at council goes wrong or you think it has. I probably was that councillor at first. But it almost never does anything to fix or improve the issue, it just feeds the ego. My focus is on fixing the issue not apportioning blame.", "content_hash": "95876c9ebb3a0e0224a3612c42383280275891d38b1815e0bf483936e0e70681", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvwocvjls2e", "cid": "bafyreify7zslmosjenvw3m5mxq5mr7cc32yq5233z23plueieg67rdjpzq", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-29T21:40:29.965Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lgvwocvjls2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lgvwocvjls2e", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jdeheij.bsky.social/post/3lggmljmcp22s", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "Speaking of her priorities for 2025, Mayor Tory Whanau (@misswhanau.bsky.social) said: “We have the lowest carbon emissions per capita in Australasia, the highest rates of public transport use, and are one of the few cities globally where biodiversity is increasing.” 👏👏", "content_hash": "49039fa7f368c106507354a014834bc93611f03c7d9b034f2712201f970d77f7", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:wbfcckij6t2pohpm3p4dlgrd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lggmljmcp22s", "cid": "bafyreig73dvof3gbgdz3ysggsa3csjtsie5thyf77wbd2fguzoexldspqu", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-23T19:30:02.849Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lggmljmcp22s.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lggmljmcp22s", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/paullecomtephoto.nz/post/3lh34tyq3622d", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "Cliff the Ambulance & Labour MPs, along with Dunedin City Councillors & staff were there to hold the govt to account. \n\n@rachelbrooking.bsky.social \n\n#Nikon #Photography #DunedinHospital #TheySaveWePay", "content_hash": "a401103ef330900b3ca055423a6846dbf818b76b4723b1370a87b4b1c25c0255", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:l43f5finrcugyqz534j5z265/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh34tyq3622d", "cid": "bafyreifsptd2caictncl4imfwuz2eaonrzljx4kg6erufz3pd5lwuufyji", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "An old ambulance has been converted to a visual prop for the state of hospital cuts in Dunedin.  The ambulance has been named Cliff. \n\nProtestors hanging around ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:l43f5finrcugyqz534j5z265/bafkreibueidnhrlscdcjli4ut5fw5pfl3hlisy3c6elrnjk2s72r5hus5i", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:l43f5finrcugyqz534j5z265/bafkreibueidnhrlscdcjli4ut5fw5pfl3hlisy3c6elrnjk2s72r5hus5i"}, {"alt": "Dunedin based Labour MP Rachel Brooking's Nissan Leaf outside the protest. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:l43f5finrcugyqz534j5z265/bafkreic7usdewfyzyshgruf4luxnh2nck6dsltbpdyhjcjbiec3fkknwpq", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:l43f5finrcugyqz534j5z265/bafkreic7usdewfyzyshgruf4luxnh2nck6dsltbpdyhjcjbiec3fkknwpq"}], "original_created_at": "2025-01-31T23:14:21.714Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lh34tyq3622d.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lh34tyq3622d", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lh2z7jz7vc2x", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "And now the building is going ahead (good that no floors are being cut) but it is not what National promised - there are fewer beds and theaters than planned in 2023.", "content_hash": "3e0104423b58524e60801ad1a94d644db4a4f37d7004b4aaf51a8da847f2134c", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh2z7jz7vc2x", "cid": "bafyreih5bsioijku7dkh4xi3qtct3wb3erooqahstyjj7bamrgad3zoota", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-31T22:09:14.033Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lh2z7jz7vc2x.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lh2z7jz7vc2x", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lh2z65foas2x", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "#cynical Typical of this government- a promise was broken and the past govt blamed. Next a preposterous option was put up (refurbishing existing hospital with its concrete cancer). The people of the south made their voices heard (thank you 35k protesters).", "content_hash": "af3b524361bb1fea16d8a21b86407929dacfdb616d8eda19e9dc3d7b8642c504", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh2z65foas2x", "cid": "bafyreia2h46lo4jjocxogbeaqql5cx4mlzvusl3mcjprkuk7d3sx32tlfm", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-31T22:08:27.255Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lh2z65foas2x.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lh2z65foas2x", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lh2z4gj6ak2x", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "🏥 Good that tertiary teaching inpatient hospital build will be restarted on consented, remediated land with piles in the ground next to the built outpatients building. Bad that (including shelling) there will be fewer beds and theatres. Thread 🧵 thespinoff.co.nz/politics/01-...", "content_hash": "f33f6bb5a65f88dc55c204a8c3883a773735c788785ad055503e36d99398356e", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh2z4gj6ak2x", "cid": "bafyreibn2lb6gpvnebbmsxdxxuouxqdeb4niujnnyyeh2mr2gnsnoq7u4u", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-31T22:07:29.698Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lh2z4gj6ak2x.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lh2z4gj6ak2x", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lgziygsdic2b", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "Totally bonkers to include coal in a special list of “critical minerals” 🤯 www.labour.org.nz/news-mining_...", "content_hash": "1951425b9f43de7d1b743769da638f684135fc247c07d23935f9b737ba04e99c", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgziygsdic2b", "cid": "bafyreiape7mpqilh4oifdlistbix47dgeduiwhtjzvqyljfa6c6de37bfe", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-31T07:46:16.169Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lgziygsdic2b.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lgziygsdic2b", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lgy7dsyric2u", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "So cynical to cut funding to DOC and then say oh the international miners can pay for pest control to protect biodiversity. The thing with Fast Track is that making the scheduled project happen (e.g. a mine) can happen without the environmental protections required under the RMA!", "content_hash": "479c351302b5fbeb67ff0f3a6c88aabf852487603c33cb6bc98e33eb480f3574", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgy7dsyric2u", "cid": "bafyreifk2a32lwbdny4nkfohrsuaf5ldzufwhbj325gumtvyxptgetyixi", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-30T19:21:00.908Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lgy7dsyric2u.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lgy7dsyric2u", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lgy7d6tnwk2u", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "Despite its name Fast Track is about tearing down protections for nature. It’s a disgrace.", "content_hash": "38fb42ea518d0bd33481df49ec7d32187e285ca812fd8a1fab5171de3209ea48", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgy7d6tnwk2u", "cid": "bafyreia757kdmkb232fayd5yf3wj3gej2f42iti7abnvd4vpsnbslko64y", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-30T19:20:39.771Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lgy7d6tnwk2u.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lgy7d6tnwk2u", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-rachel-brooking", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social/post/3lgy57itycc2u", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:16+00:00", "content": "Shane Jones is right - mines scheduled in FastTrack will go ahead. But they won’t have the same environmental controls as mines approved under the RMA because the new law trumps protections of nature. Fasttrack could do better- even Straterra submitted to include protections 🦗🐸", "content_hash": "a22fa1deba03aeae4a58e559bd5f6aed9483f35cd56cf27e1bc48efe6d406b8b", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:qtrgsyyfdgiivxwq5gfdsmgw/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgy57itycc2u", "cid": "bafyreidftkvlwjwqnsl5ah6gjeqys5bjokw5o5rngjfyevoeshomx3xvny", "source_id": "person-rachel-brooking-bluesky-8aa9fd14"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-01-30T18:42:48.560Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-01/3lgy57itycc2u.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lgy57itycc2u", "source_account": "rachelbrooking.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rachelbrooking.bsky.social"}
